  <metadata>
    <name>Maja Rosit (Rosni vrh) – Katun Zastan</name>
    <desc>The Maja Rosit trail leads from the summit of Maja e Rosit / Rosni vrh (2523 m a.s.l.) toward the valley, passing by a viewpoint and the Ćafa e Farumit pass. It is 4,4 km long with an estimated duration of 2 h 50 min. Route data © OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL (https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright). Elevation produced using Copernicus WorldDEM-30 © DLR e.V. 2010-2014 and © Airbus Defence and Space GmbH 2014-2018 provided under COPERNICUS by the European Union and ESA; all rights reserved.</desc>
